# Sethos Emilie Kuki Mavuika. ~16 Rot. Sethos Quickburn. Mavuika bursts every other rotation. Mavuika fills time for Sethos skill CD on subsequent rotations when she can burst. Kuki burst when available. Full EM and Quicken Kuki result in similar overall DPS.

